        "content": "### Learning Objectives\nBy the end of this module, you will be able to:\n1. Understand what hiring managers and technical lead recruiters look for in a **Data Analytics Portfolio**.\n2. Organize project directories with standardized industry folder structures (`/data`, `/notebooks`, `/sql`, `/dashboards`, `/reports`).\n3. Author a high-impact **GitHub README.md** featuring Executive Summary, Problem Statement, Methodology, Key Findings, and Actionable Recommendations.\n4. Host and embed interactive Power BI / Tableau dashboards on public web portfolios.\n5. Obfuscate and anonymize sensitive commercial data (compliance with Kenya Data Protection Act and GDPR).\n\n---\n\n### 1. Gold-Standard Data Project Repository Architecture\n\n```\nfahmrise-kenya-retail-analytics/\n├── README.md                   # The #1 document recruiters read!\n├── requirements.txt            # Python dependencies (pandas, seaborn, etc.)\n├── data/\n│   ├── raw/                    # Original unedited datasets (anonymized)\n│   └── processed/              # Cleaned, ready-for-analysis datasets\n├── sql/\n│   ├── 01_schema_setup.sql     # DDL table definitions\n│   ├── 02_aggregations.sql     # GROUP BY and KPI calculations\n│   └── 03_cohort_analysis.sql  # CTEs and Window functions\n├── notebooks/\n│   └── exploratory_analysis.ipynb # Clean, documented Jupyter notebook\n├── dashboards/\n│   └── executive_report.pbix   # Power BI report file + Web Embed Link\n└── reports/\n    └── executive_summary.pdf   # 1-Page Minto memo for leadership\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. Anatomy of a 10/10 GitHub README\n\nA great README must contain:\n1. **Hero Title & Badges**: Clean project name with tech stack badges (Python, SQL, Power BI, PostgreSQL).\n2. **Executive Summary**: 3 bullet points summarizing the business impact and core findings.\n3. **Interactive Demo Link**: Direct link to view the live dashboard in a browser.\n4. **Business Problem Statement**: Context and strategic questions addressed.\n5. **Key Insights & Visual Highlights**: Embedded high-resolution PNG charts with callout annotations.\n6. **Strategic Business Recommendations**: Concrete actions with estimated financial impact.\n7. **How to Reproduce**: Step-by-step terminal instructions to clone and run the analysis locally.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Summary & Best Practices\n- 90% of recruiters will only read your README. Make your README visual, structured, and business-focused!\n- Never commit private API keys, passwords, or personal identifiable customer phone numbers (PII).",
