        "title": "Module 2: Purification & Preparation (Taharah & Wudu)",
        "subtitle": "Spiritual and physical cleanliness, step-by-step Wudu according to Sunnah, nullifiers, Tayammum, and Ghusl",
        "readingTime": "20 min",
        "summary": "Master the essential rites of Islamic purification (Taharah). Learn the precise Sunnah method of performing Wudu, what nullifies it, and the basics of Ghusl and Tayammum.",
