        "readingTime": "22 min",
        "summary": "Follow a comprehensive, step-by-step physical and verbal walkthrough of how to perform 2-Rak'ah (Fajr), 3-Rak'ah (Maghrib), and 4-Rak'ah (Dhuhr, Asr, Isha) prayers.",
