        "content": "\n# Module 7: Revision, Step-by-Step Self-Assessment & Prayer Checklist\n\nCongratulations on completing the core modules of **Salah From Zero: Prayer & Its Meaning**!\n\n---\n\n## 1. Summary of Our 7-Module Journey\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                     FAHMRISE SALAH CURRICULUM OVERVIEW                  │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Module 1: Significance & Spiritual Foundations (2nd Pillar, Mi'raj)     │\n│ Module 2: Taharah & Wudu (Physical & Ritual Purification, Sunnah Steps) │\n│ Module 3: Conditions & Pillars (Prerequisites, Arkan, Madhahib Respect) │\n│ Module 4: Step-by-Step Practical Guide (Postures, 2/3/4 Rak'ah flows)   │\n│ Module 5: Recitations & Khushu' (Word-by-word Tashahhud, Durood, Du'a)  │\n│ Module 6: Mistakes & Sujood as-Sahw (Rectifying errors, Jumu'ah, Qasr)  │\n│ Module 7: Comprehensive Self-Audit & Lifelong Prayer Blueprint          │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. The Daily Prayer Mastery Checklist\n\nUse this 5-point audit before every prayer:\n1. **Purity Check**: Is my Wudu valid? Are my clothes, body, and prayer rug clean?\n2. **Time & Direction**: Has the prayer time entered? Am I facing the Qiblah?\n3. **Internal Intention**: Have I dedicated this prayer sincerely to Allah alone?\n4. **Physical Stillness**: Am I pausing with *Tuma'neenah* in every Ruku' and Sujood?\n5. **Heart Presence**: Am I contemplating the words of Surah Al-Fatihah and the Tashahhud?\n\nMay Allah accept your prayers, make you and your descendants among those who establish regular prayer (*Muqeem as-Salah*), and grant you the ultimate peace in this life and the next!\n      ",
