        "content": "\n# Module 7: Revision, Creed Synthesis & Knowledge Assessment\n\nCongratulations on reaching the final capstone module of **Islamic Aqeedah From Zero**!\n\n---\n\n## 1. Summary of Our 7-Module Journey\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    FAHMRISE AQEEDAH CURRICULUM OVERVIEW                 │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Module 1: Foundations of Creed (Islam, Iman, Ihsan, Hadith Jibreel)     │\n│ Module 2: Belief in Allah (Tawheed Rububiyyah, Uluhiyyah, Asma' wa-Sifat)│\n│ Module 3: Angels & Revealed Scriptures (Mala'ikah, Jibreel, Preserved)  │\n│ Module 4: Prophets & Messengers (Attributes, 25 Named, Khatam an-Nabiyyin)│\n│ Module 5: The Day of Judgment (Barzakh, Resurrection, Meezan, Jannah)   │\n│ Module 6: Divine Decree (Al-Qadr: 4 Levels, Human Free Will, Tawakkul)  │\n│ Module 7: Comprehensive Synthesis & Lifelong Creed Blueprint            │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. The Core Creedal Manifesto of the Believer\n\n1. **My Lord is Allah Alone**: Creator, Sustainer, and Sole Object of all worship, love, fear, and reliance.\n2. **My Guide is the Noble Qur'an**: The uncreated, preserved Word of Allah.\n3. **My Leader and Exemplar is Prophet Muhammad ﷺ**: The final Seal of the Prophets whose Sunnah is my pathway to Paradise.\n4. **My Destination is the Hereafter**: Striving daily for Allah's Good Pleasure and the eternal gardens of Jannah.\n5. **My Trust is in Al-Qadr**: Living with active effort (*Asbab*) and tranquil reliance (*Tawakkul*).\n\nMay Allah keep your heart steadfast upon the true faith:\n> **«يَا مُقَلِّبَ الْقُلُوبِ ثَبِّتْ قَلْبِي عَلَى دِينِكَ»**  \n> *Ya Muqallib al-Qulub, thabbit qalbi 'ala deenik.*  \n> *\"O Turner of the hearts, keep my heart steadfast upon Your religion.\"* (Jami' at-Tirmidhi 3522).\n      ",
