        "content": "\n# Module 7: Revision, Character Growth Plan & Knowledge Assessment\n\nCongratulations on reaching the final capstone module of **Islamic Manners, Character & Daily Duas**!\n\n---\n\n## 1. Summary of Our 7-Module Journey\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                    FAHMRISE AKHLAQ & DU'A CURRICULUM OVERVIEW           │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Module 1: Foundations of Character (Husn al-Khuluq, Scales, Ikhlas)     │\n│ Module 2: Core Virtues (Sidq, Amanah, Haya', Tawadu' vs. Kibr)          │\n│ Module 3: Rights in Relationships (Parents, Kinship, Neighbours)        │\n│ Module 4: Social Etiquette & Speech (Salam, Eating, Hifdh al-Lisan)     │\n│ Module 5: Verified Daily Duas (Waking, Sleeping, Home, Bathroom, Travel)│\n│ Module 6: Morning & Evening Adhkar (Fortress, Sayyid al-Istighfar)      │\n│ Module 7: Comprehensive Habit Tracker & Final Capstone Assessment       │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. Your Daily Prophetic Lifestyle Habit Tracker\n\nImplement this simple daily checklist:\n1. **Morning**: Recite waking Du'a + Morning Adhkar (Ayat al-Kursi, 3 Quls, Sayyid al-Istighfar, Bismillahilladhi...).\n2. **Throughout the Day**: Say Salam first, eat with right hand with Bismillah, guard the tongue from backbiting, smile at people.\n3. **Evening**: Recite Evening Adhkar + du'as for entering/leaving home.\n4. **Night**: Recite sleeping Du'a + Ayat al-Kursi, asking Allah to forgive any shortcomings.\n\nMay Allah beautify your inward character as He has beautified your outward form:\n> **«اللَّهُمَّ كَمَا حَسَّنْتَ خَلْقِي فَحَسِّنْ خُلُقِي»**  \n> *Allahumma kama hassanta khalqi fa-hassin khuluqi.*  \n> *\"O Allah, just as You have beautified my physical form, so too beautify my moral character.\"* (Musnad Ahmad 24392 — Sahih).\n      ",
